       "    <tr>\n",
       "      <th>1</th>\n",
       "      <td>CC1(C(N2C(S1)C(C2=O)NC(=O)C(C3=CC=C(C=C3)O)N)C...</td>\n",
       "      <td>Amoxicilline</td>\n",
       "      <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"width: 200px; height: 200px\" data-content=\"rdkit/molecule\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"Mol\"/></div></td>\n",
       "    </tr>\n",
       "    <tr>\n",
       "      <th>2</th>\n",
       "      <td>C1=COC(=C1)CNC2=CC(=C(C=C2C(=O)O)S(=O)(=O)N)Cl</td>\n",
       "      <td>Furosemide</td>\n",
       "      <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"width: 200px; height: 200px\" data-content=\"rdkit/molecule\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"Mol\"/></div></td>\n",
       "    </tr>\n",
       "    <tr>\n",
       "      <th>3</th>\n",
       "      <td>CCCCCCCCCCCC(=O)OCCOC(=O)CCCCCCCCCCC</td>\n",
       "      <td>Glycol dilaurate</td>\n",
       "      <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"width: 200px; height: 200px\" data-content=\"rdkit/molecule\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"Mol\"/></div></td>\n",
       "    </tr>\n",
       "    <tr>\n",
       "      <th>4</th>\n",
       "      <td>C1NC2=CC(=C(C=C2S(=O)(=O)N1)S(=O)(=O)N)Cl</td>\n",
       "      <td>Hydrochlorothiazide</td>\n",
       "      <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"width: 200px; height: 200px\" data-content=\"rdkit/molecule\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"Mol\"/></div></td>\n",
       "    </tr>\n",
       "    <tr>\n",
       "      <th>5</th>\n",
       "      <td>CC1=C(C(CCC1)(C)C)C=CC(=CC=CC(=CC(=O)O)C)C</td>\n",
       "      <td>Isotretinoin</td>\n",
       "      <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"width: 200px; height: 200px\" data-content=\"rdkit/molecule\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"Mol\"/></div></td>\n",
       "    </tr>\n",
       "    <tr>\n",
       "      <th>6</th>\n",
       "      <td>CC1(C2CC3C(C(=O)C(=C(C3(C(=O)C2=C(C4=C1C=CC=C4...</td>\n",
       "      <td>Tetracycline</td>\n",
       "      <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"width: 200px; height: 200px\" data-content=\"rdkit/molecule\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"Mol\"/></div></td>\n",
       "    </tr>\n",
       "    <tr>\n",
       "      <th>7</th>\n",
       "      <td>CC1C(CC(=O)C2=C1C=CC=C2O)C(=O)O</td>\n",
       "      <td>Hemi-cycline D</td>\n",
       "      <td style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"width: 200px; height: 200px\" data-content=\"rdkit/molecule\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"Mol\"/></div></td>\n",
       "    </tr>\n",
       "  </tbody>\n",
       "</table>\n",
       "</div>"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "                                              smiles                 name  \\\n",
       "0  CC1C2C(C3C(C(=O)C(=C(C3(C(=O)C2=C(C4=C1C=CC=C4...          Doxycycline   \n",
       "1  CC1(C(N2C(S1)C(C2=O)NC(=O)C(C3=CC=C(C=C3)O)N)C...         Amoxicilline   \n",
       "2     C1=COC(=C1)CNC2=CC(=C(C=C2C(=O)O)S(=O)(=O)N)Cl           Furosemide   \n",
       "3               CCCCCCCCCCCC(=O)OCCOC(=O)CCCCCCCCCCC     Glycol dilaurate   \n",
       "4          C1NC2=CC(=C(C=C2S(=O)(=O)N1)S(=O)(=O)N)Cl  Hydrochlorothiazide   \n",
       "5         CC1=C(C(CCC1)(C)C)C=CC(=CC=CC(=CC(=O)O)C)C         Isotretinoin   \n",
       "6  CC1(C2CC3C(C(=O)C(=C(C3(C(=O)C2=C(C4=C1C=CC=C4...         Tetracycline   \n",
       "7                    CC1C(CC(=O)C2=C1C=CC=C2O)C(=O)O       Hemi-cycline D   \n",
       "\n",
       "                                              ROMol  \n",
       "0  <rdkit.Chem.rdchem.Mol object at 0x7f115ab20040>  \n",
       "1  <rdkit.Chem.rdchem.Mol object at 0x7f115a632c70>  \n",
       "2  <rdkit.Chem.rdchem.Mol object at 0x7f115a632c00>  \n",
       "3  <rdkit.Chem.rdchem.Mol object at 0x7f115a632e30>  \n",
       "4  <rdkit.Chem.rdchem.Mol object at 0x7f115a632f10>  \n",
       "5  <rdkit.Chem.rdchem.Mol object at 0x7f115a632d50>  \n",
       "6  <rdkit.Chem.rdchem.Mol object at 0x7f115a632f80>  \n",
       "7  <rdkit.Chem.rdchem.Mol object at 0x7f115a632ff0>  "
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 5,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "PandasTools.AddMoleculeColumnToFrame(molecules, smilesCol=\"smiles\")\n",
    "PandasTools.RenderImagesInAllDataFrames(True) #to force rendring images (optional)\n",
    "molecules"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f23cd796-2a56-477b-a57e-36834e0569b8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Visualize all molecules"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "0e9cc4ff-4479-4e2b-87ad-9d158ad5004b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<IPython.core.display.Image object>"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 6,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "Draw.MolsToGridImage(\n",
    "    molecules[\"ROMol\"].to_list(),\n",
    "    molsPerRow =3,\n",
    "    subImgSize=(450, 150),\n",
    "    legends=molecules[\"name\"].to_list(),\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "36b22f98-f5cf-4d62-9c53-9c75a5d0a766",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "As we can see, molecules with similar molecular weight can have a similar structure (e.g. Doxycycline/Tetracycline), however they can also have a similar number of atoms in completely different arrangements (e.g. Doxycycline/Glycol dilaurate or Hydrochlorothiazide/Isotretinoin).\n",
    "\n",
    "In order to account for more detailed properties of a molecule, we now take a look at 2D molecular descriptors."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a1432e2c-5f88-41d8-a69a-f9649bc43cca",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### II.2 2D molecular descriptors: \n",
    "\n",
    "#### II.2.1 2D molecular descriptors : MACCS fingerprint"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "93fdd87d-a202-4567-b2f6-a2d44e84ab79",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "__Example molecule__: Let's use an example molecule from our `DataFrame`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 7,
   "id": "6f53e868-63aa-4da3-be1f-723491a34975",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<rdkit.Chem.rdchem.Mol at 0x7f115ab20040>"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 7,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "molecule = molecules[\"ROMol\"][0]\n",
    "molecule"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b2814e74-1c21-4b14-b1aa-180f3376673a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "MACCS fingerprints can be easily generated using `rdkit`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "7f49008f-42ac-4a43-a028-d9551427a0a8",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "maccs_fp = MACCSkeys.GenMACCSKeys(molecule)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 9,
   "id": "77fb9b4e-a659-42ba-8c83-0aa4d5600036",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "<rdkit.DataStructs.cDataStructs.ExplicitBitVect at 0x7f115a348d60>"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 9,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "maccs_fp"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "122d1acd-67c4-44fa-a1dc-3fe5b3d946bb",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "As explicit bitvectors are not human-readable, we will further transform them to bitstrings."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "id": "a5003db8-7627-4717-af13-e851a097912c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "'00000000000000000000000000100000000000000000000000100110000000000010000010101000000011100100110101010100010000101100010000100001000101001001111111101111101011111111110'"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 10,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "maccs_fp.ToBitString()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d82847e2-7def-4b5c-a012-2887e7987d36",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "__Applied to all molecules__: Add MACCS fingerprints for all molecules to the `DataFrame`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 11,
   "id": "ae101a7f-4bd8-4502-a804-2f2c6a12cd3a",
   "metadata": {
    "scrolled": true
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "molecules[\"maccs\"] = molecules[\"ROMol\"].apply(MACCSkeys.GenMACCSKeys)\n",
    "molecules"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "85542e6b-293c-4a27-8ab6-a61cbcf7bff0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### II.2.2 2D molecular descriptors: Morgan fingerprint"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "01cb2d79-bb97-4b4d-8199-1469930d2f4c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "We can also calculate the circular Morgan fingerprints with `rdkit`. The Morgan fingerprint can be calculated either as int or bit vector. We specify a radius of 2 and a vector of length 2048.\n",
    "\n",
    "__Example molecule__: Let's use again with our example molecule."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "id": "1ab9f04c-a258-4444-9c2e-a3c1deedf4ba",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#first we deploy a finger print generator\n",
    "fpg = rdFingerprintGenerator.GetMorganGenerator(radius=2, fpSize=2048)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e5486693-de87-476f-af71-78531e4a768d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Generate the Morgan fingerprint _as int vector_."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 13,
   "id": "20ea6370-512f-4e7b-9cd0-798af818b76f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "circular_int_fp = fpg.GetCountFingerprint(molecule)\n",
    "circular_int_fp"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 14,
   "id": "402bd694-6558-48a1-939c-18038a224a3a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Print non-zero elements:\n",
      "{45: 1, 118: 1, 140: 1, 163: 1, 276: 1, 303: 1, 309: 1, 314: 2, 371: 1, 438: 1, 525: 1, 557: 1, 650: 3, 673: 1, 699: 1, 807: 6, 824: 1, 829: 1, 881: 1, 1009: 1, 1019: 5, 1027: 1, 1039: 1, 1057: 3, 1060: 1, 1061: 1, 1070: 1, 1082: 1, 1088: 1, 1119: 1, 1154: 1, 1163: 2, 1171: 1, 1257: 1, 1296: 1, 1309: 1, 1341: 1, 1380: 9, 1389: 1, 1457: 1, 1471: 1, 1487: 1, 1582: 1, 1602: 3, 1607: 1, 1630: 1, 1747: 1, 1750: 2, 1831: 1, 1833: 1, 1857: 1, 1873: 3, 1917: 1, 1932: 1, 2000: 1, 2029: 1}\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# NBVAL_CHECK_OUTPUT\n",
    "print(f\"Print non-zero elements:\\n{circular_int_fp.GetNonzeroElements()}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dfcdd783-cfe8-4811-a43c-0ef218a0a806",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Generate the Morgan fingerprint _as bit vector_."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 15,
   "id": "b47e7151-b1cb-4801-b5d0-5e89c1f016a6",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "<rdkit.DataStructs.cDataStructs.ExplicitBitVect at 0x7f1159f74d60>"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 15,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# Note that the function takes a list as input parameter\n",
    "# (even if we only want to pass one molecule)\n",
    "circular_bit_fp = fpg.GetFingerprint(molecule)\n",
    "circular_bit_fp"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 16,
   "id": "24912de0-d135-4875-a382-8cc410a9e535",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Print top 400 fingerprint bits:\n",
      "\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# NBVAL_CHECK_OUTPUT\n",
    "print(f\"Print top 400 fingerprint bits:\\n{circular_bit_fp.ToBitString()[:400]}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "02430208-7ec9-429f-9643-a48ab694b249",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "__Applied to all molecules__: Add Morgan fingerprints (as bit vector) for all molecules to the `DataFrame`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 17,
   "id": "1ca4cf6e-582a-43ea-8680-8a6269a4b9c8",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "ename": "NameError",
     "evalue": "name 'molecules' is not defined",
     "output_type": "error",
     "traceback": [
      "\u001b[31m---------------------------------------------------------------------------\u001b[39m",
      "\u001b[31mNameError\u001b[39m                                 Traceback (most recent call last)",
      "\u001b[36mCell\u001b[39m\u001b[36m \u001b[39m\u001b[32mIn[1]\u001b[39m\u001b[32m, line 1\u001b[39m\n\u001b[32m----> \u001b[39m\u001b[32m1\u001b[39m molecules[\u001b[33m\"\u001b[39m\u001b[33mmorgan\u001b[39m\u001b[33m\"\u001b[39m] = \u001b[43mmolecules\u001b[49m[\u001b[33m\"\u001b[39m\u001b[33mROMol\u001b[39m\u001b[33m\"\u001b[39m].map(fpg.GetFingerprint)\n",
      "\u001b[31mNameError\u001b[39m: name 'molecules' is not defined"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "molecules[\"morgan\"] = molecules[\"ROMol\"].map(fpg.GetFingerprint)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "bdcd291e-9a6c-4fdf-b417-2c580de0474e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### II.3 Calculate molecular similarity\n",
    "\n",
    "In the following, we will apply two similarity measures, i.e. **Tanimoto** and **Dice**, to our two fingerprint types, i.e. **MACCS** and **Morgan** fingerprints.\n",
    "\n",
    "__Example molecule pair__: Compare two MACCS fingerprints with the Tanimoto similarity."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 18,
   "id": "c3d5c357-1ec5-4518-990c-c45007f54b5b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Example molecules\n",
    "molecule1 = molecules[\"ROMol\"][0]\n",
    "molecule2 = molecules[\"ROMol\"][1]\n",
    "\n",
    "# Example fingerprints\n",
    "maccs_fp1 = MACCSkeys.GenMACCSKeys(molecule1)\n",
    "maccs_fp2 = MACCSkeys.GenMACCSKeys(molecule2)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e9e07c88-9c53-40c8-b40a-957b09f4a363",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Calculate the Tanimoto coefficient _between two different molecules_."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 21,
   "id": "0c27b16d-0c7d-4490-858d-f72db7b9149a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "0.5909090909090909"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 21,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# NBVAL_CHECK_OUTPUT\n",
    "DataStructs.TanimotoSimilarity(maccs_fp1, maccs_fp2)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dba3a4d6-3bba-409b-864c-893ea5daec59",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Calculate Tanimoto coefficient _between the same molecule_."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 20,
   "id": "80f00f28-8365-463c-bced-5be0cfb665a9",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "1.0"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 20,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# NBVAL_CHECK_OUTPUT\n",
    "DataStructs.TanimotoSimilarity(maccs_fp1, maccs_fp1)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e2aa5272-5d04-4527-80f0-e722f186ab95",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "In the following, we want to compare a query molecule with our molecule list. \n",
    "Therefore, we use `BulkTanimotoSimilarity` and `BulkDiceSimilarity` from `rdkit` that calculate the similarity of a query fingerprint with a list of fingerprints, based on a similarity measure. We will investigate all combinations of MACCS/Morgan fingerprint comparisons based on the Tanimoto/Dice similarity measure."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "943b6759-b86d-438e-9ca7-9068002c9ae3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### II.3.1 MACCS fingerprints: Tanimoto similarity and Dice similarity"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "bbe409b1-8788-4698-9c3f-88816d5b9fa3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Add the Tanimoto and Dice similarities between MACCS fingerprints to the DataFrame."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 29,
   "id": "997bfe98-1030-423b-b1c5-906154f24c66",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Define molecule query and list\n",
    "molecule_query = molecules[\"maccs\"][0]\n",
    "molecule_list = molecules[\"maccs\"].to_list()\n",
    "# Calculate similarty values between query and list elements\n",
    "molecules[\"tanimoto_maccs\"] = DataStructs.BulkTanimotoSimilarity(molecule_query, molecule_list)\n",
    "molecules[\"dice_maccs\"] = DataStructs.BulkDiceSimilarity(molecule_query, molecule_list)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0578e22a-4ae6-4836-86c3-72d91dcceb59",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Sort the DataFrame by the Tanimoto similarity of the MACCS fingerprints (show only name and similarity columns!)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 31,
   "id": "2501dec4-c54f-4cda-99e5-5f05ee77a93a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/html": [
       "<div>\n",
       "<style scoped>\n",
       "    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n",
       "        vertical-align: middle;\n",
       "    }\n",
       "\n",
       "    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n",
       "        vertical-align: top;\n",
       "    }\n",
       "\n",
       "    .dataframe thead th {\n",
       "        text-align: right;\n",
       "    }\n",
       "</style>\n",
       "<table border=\"1\" class=\"dataframe\">\n",
       "  <thead>\n",
       "    <tr style=\"text-align: right;\">\n",
       "      <th></th>\n",
       "      <th>name</th>\n",
       "      <th>tanimoto_maccs</th>\n",
       "      <th>dice_maccs</th>\n",
       "    </tr>\n",
       "  </thead>\n",
       "  <tbody>\n",
       "    <tr>\n",
       "      <th>0</th>\n",
       "      <td>Doxycycline</td>\n",
       "      <td>1.000000</td>\n",
       "      <td>1.000000</td>\n",
       "    </tr>\n",
       "    <tr>\n",
       "      <th>1</th>\n",
       "      <td>Tetracycline</td>\n",
       "      <td>0.928571</td>\n",
       "      <td>0.962963</td>\n",
