   "source": [
    "preview = molecules.sort_values([\"tanimoto_maccs\"], ascending=False).reset_index()\n",
    "preview[[\"name\", \"tanimoto_maccs\", \"dice_maccs\"]]\n",
    "# NBVAL_CHECK_OUTPUT"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4ebdd125-696e-461f-906f-cc9eb6f8c346",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "__Note__: Tanimoto and Dice similarity measures by definition result in the same ranking of molecules, with higher values for the Dice similarity (see Tanimoto and Dice equations in the theory section of this NB)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "56877234-5121-479d-a53d-daa1eaa8ea28",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Draw molecules ranked by the Tanimoto similarity of MACCS fingerprints."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 35,
   "id": "b61f428f-f2d7-48bb-805a-3f537beb09cc",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def draw_ranked_molecules(molecules, sort_by_column):\n",
    "    molecules_sorted = molecules.sort_values([sort_by_column], ascending=False).reset_index()\n",
    "    return Draw.MolsToGridImage(\n",
    "        molecules_sorted[\"ROMol\"],\n",
    "        legends=[\n",
    "            f\"#{index+1} {molecule['name']}, similarity={molecule[sort_by_column]:.2f}\"\n",
    "            for index, molecule in molecules_sorted.iterrows()\n",
    "        ],\n",
    "        molsPerRow=3,\n",
    "        subImgSize=(450, 150),\n",
    "    )"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 36,
   "id": "815d260a-6ddd-432d-bfc5-93befb0fe294",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<IPython.core.display.Image object>"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 36,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "draw_ranked_molecules(molecules, \"tanimoto_maccs\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "adf8d24d-5266-44a6-a235-4ed0187480d2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "With MACCS fingerprints, Tetracycline is the most similar molecule (high score), followed by Amoxicilline. In contrast to the 1D descriptor molecular weight, the linear molecule Glycol dilaurate is recognized as dissimilar (last rank)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4d05714d-ef1d-4fc2-a2cf-379756c1e552",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### II.3.2 Morgan fingerprints: Tanimoto similarity and Dice similarity"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2a22488f-734a-4e84-bc78-215ed5732653",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Add the Tanimoto and Dice similarities between the Morgan fingerprints to the DataFrame"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 39,
   "id": "92f058a9-d2ec-40bb-b4a5-89b4dedf0120",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Define molecule query and list\n",
    "molecule_query = molecules[\"morgan\"][0]\n",
    "molecule_list = molecules[\"morgan\"].to_list()\n",
    "# Calculate similarty values between query and list elements\n",
    "molecules[\"tanimoto_morgan\"] = DataStructs.BulkTanimotoSimilarity(molecule_query, molecule_list)\n",
    "molecules[\"dice_morgan\"] = DataStructs.BulkDiceSimilarity(molecule_query, molecule_list)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "80001de6-134d-46cc-8ee2-f0a9b55c8e7e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Sort the DataFrame by the Tanimoto similarity of the Morgan fingerprints."
